et <NOTE N="(d)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0159" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0159"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>pavntaû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  omnes †
curavit:
