quoniam ipsorum
est regnum
caelorum.
11. Beati estis cum
vos <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0161" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0161"></COL> Ista. . . .  <HI REND="ITALIC">quent, . . . . . . cent,</HI>  ita supplenda sunt,  <HI REND="ITALIC">maledicent, persequentur, dicent,</HI> 
