Quod si sal
evanuerit,
quo sallietur?
ad nihilum valet <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0163" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0163"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">valet,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">ultra:</HI>  et ita in Cant., Gr. et Lat.</NOTE> ,
