dimiserit
uxorem suam, <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0267" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0267"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>parektoúû lovgou porneivaû.</FOREIGN></NOTE> 
nisi ob causam
