40. Qui recipit
vos, me recipit:
et qui me recipit,
recipit eum,
qui me misit.
41. Qui recipit
prophetam in
nomine prophetae,
mercedem
prophetae accipiet:
 <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0203"></COL> ( <HI REND="ITALIC">c</HI> ) Haec,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et qui recipit,</HI>  etc., usque ad,  <HI REND="ITALIC">accipiet,</HI>  desunt in Cant. Gr. et Lat.</NOTE>  et qui
recipit justum
in nomine justi,
mercedem justi
