quodcumque
est ex
me, tibi proderit,
6. <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0239" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0239"></COL> Ante  <HI REND="ITALIC">non,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">et,</HI>  in
cod. quoque Cant.</NOTE>  non honorificavit
