de vobis <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0241" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0241"></COL> Ita et textus Graecus  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Hsaivaû,</FOREIGN>  ex Latinorum consuetudine vertendi  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>H</FOREIGN>  Graecum in  <HI REND="ITALIC">E.</HI></NOTE> 
Eseias †, dicens:
