25. Ad illa veniens
 <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0243" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0243"></COL> Ita et textus Graecus  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>prosekuvnei.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  adorabat
