quia <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0245" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0245"></COL> Ita et textus Graecus,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>hædh hJmevrai
