11. Et accipientes
 <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0275" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0275"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejgovggusan.</FOREIGN></NOTE> 
murmuraverunt
