 <COL N="0290"></COL> ejus.
39. Et adprehensum
eum <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0289" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0289"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajpevkteinan kaiú ejxevbalon eæxw touð ajmpelwðnoû,</FOREIGN>  ac antiqua versio Saxon.</NOTE>  occiderunt,
et
