Malos male
perdet: et vineam
suam
locavit aliis
colonis, qui
 <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0289" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0289"></COL> Ita et textus Graecus,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajpodwvsousin aujtwðé touúû karpouúû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  reddent ei
