20. <NOTE N="(e)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0293" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0293"></COL> Ante  <HI REND="ITALIC">ait,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">et,</HI>  in
cod. quoque Cant.</NOTE>  Ait † illis Jesus:
Cujus est
