 <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0297" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0297"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant. Lat. et Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>evp1 aujtovn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  ad
