eum <NOTE N="(d)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0297" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0297"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">in spiritu,</HI>  cod. quoque Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn pneuvmati.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  in spiritu †
