 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0299" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0299"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>profavsei makraðé.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  occansione
