est: <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0358" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0358"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Gat.</HI>  qui prior.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vulg.</HI>  quia prior.</NOTE>  quoniam
prior me erat.
31. Et ego ignorabam
illum, sed <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0358" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0358"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Gat. et Mm.</HI>  ut manifestaretur Israel.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vulg.</HI>  ut manifestetur
in Israel.</NOTE>  ut
