Tu Simon
 <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0360" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0360"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Gat.</HI>  filius Johna.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Mm.</HI>  filius Johannis.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vulg.</HI>  filius Jona.</NOTE>  filius Johannes:
tu vocaveris
Cephas
