supra Filium</P> <CAPTION COM="0361">CAPUT II.</CAPTION> <P COM="0361">1. hominis. Et
die tertia
 <COL N="0361"></COL> nuptiae fiebant
 <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0362" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0362"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Gat.</HI>  In Chanaan.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vulg.</HI>  In Cana.</NOTE>  in Cana
Galileae: et erat
ibi mater
