et ibi manserunt
 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0363" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0363"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ouj pollaúû hJmevraû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  non
