Jesus discipulis
 <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0493" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0493"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">suis,</HI>  cod. quoque Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aujtouð.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  suis † ad mare
2. Tiberiadis: et
