 <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0494" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0494"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Gat.</HI>  a Channan.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vulg.</HI>  a Cana.</NOTE>  a Cana
