illum:
 <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0496" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0496"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Mm.</HI>  ei, tu . . . Dominus esset.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vulg.</HI>  eum, tu . . . Dominus
est.</NOTE>  Tu qui es? scientes,
quod Dominus
13. est. <NOTE N="(f)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0495" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0495"></COL> Ante  <HI REND="ITALIC">venit,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">et,</HI>  etiam in tex. Gr.</NOTE>  Venit † Jesus,
et <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0496" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0496"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Gat.</HI>  accepit panem, et dedit eis.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Mm.</HI>  accepit panem,
et benedixit, et dedit eis.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vulg.</HI>  accipit panem, et dat
eis.</NOTE>  sumpsit panem,
 <COL N="0497"></COL> et dedit
illis, et piscis
