40. Haec est <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0395" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0395"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>gaúr.</FOREIGN></NOTE> 
enim † voluntas
Patris <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0395" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0395"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">mei,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">qui misit me,</HI>  etiam
in cod. Cant.</NOTE>  mei †:
ut omnes, qui
videt Filium,
et credit in
