vitam aeternam <NOTE N="(d)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0395" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0395"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">et,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">ego,</HI>  in cod. pariter Cant.</NOTE> ,
et †
resuscitabo eum
in novissima die.
41. Murmurabant
igitur Judaei
de eo, eo quod
dixisset: Ego
sum <NOTE N="(e)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0395" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0395"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">panis,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">vivus</HI>  in cod. quoque Cant.</NOTE>  panis †,
qui de caelo
descendi, et
42. dicebant: Nonne
hic est filius
Joseph, cujus
noscimus
Patrem? Quomodo
ergo hic
