quia nemo
potest venire
ad me, nisi
ei datum fuerit
a <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0399" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0399"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">Patre,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">meo,</HI>  etiam in cod. Cant.</NOTE>  Patre †.
67. Ex hoc <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0399" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0399"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">ergo,</HI> 
