2. Erat autem
in proximo dies
sollemnis Judaeorum, Scenopegiae.
3. Dixerunt
 <NOTE N="(g)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0399" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0399"></COL> Ita et text. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ouøn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  igitur
† ad eum
fratres ipsius:
Transi hinc, et
 <COL N="0402"></COL> vade in Judaeam,
ut et
discipuli tui
4. videant <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0401" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0401"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">opera,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">tua,</HI>  in cod. quoque Cant.</NOTE>  opera
†, quae facis.
Nemo enim
aliquid faciens
