5. Neque enim
fratres ejus
credebant <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0401" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0401"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">tunc,</HI>  etiam cod. Cant.</NOTE> 
tunc † in eum.
6. Dicit ergo
eis Jesus: Tempus
