remansit
ipse <NOTE N="(d)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0401" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0401"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eijû thún Galilaivan.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  in Galilaeam
†.
10. Cum autem
ascenderunt fratres
ejus, tunc
 <COL N="0402"></COL> et ipse ascendit
in diem festum
