sed <NOTE N="(e)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0401" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0401"></COL> Ante  <HI REND="ITALIC">occulte,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">quasi,</HI>  in cod.
quoque Cant.</NOTE>  occulte
11. †. Judaei
autem quaerebant
