dicentes: Quomodo
hic litteras
novit,
cum non didicerit?
16. Respondit
autem
 <NOTE N="(f)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0401" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0401"></COL> Ante  <HI REND="ITALIC">Jesus,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">eis,</HI>  etiam in vers. Goth.</NOTE>  Jesus †, et
