 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0405" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0405"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">de eo,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">haec,</HI>  etiam in cod. Cant.</NOTE>  de eo †:
