Liberi eritis?
34. Respondit
Jesus: Amen,
amen dico
vobis: quia
omnes, qui
facit peccatum,
servus <NOTE N="(d)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">est,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">peccati,</HI>  etiam in cod. Cant.</NOTE>  est †.
35. Servus autem
 <COL N="0414"></COL> non manet in
domo in aeternum:
nam Filius
manet in
