et opera, quae
ego facio, ipse
11. facit <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0455" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0455"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>pisteuvetev moi.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  Credite
