aput vos <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0455" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0455"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>mevnei.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  manet
