a me <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Gat.</HI>  omnes operamini iniquitates.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Mm.</HI>  omnes, qui
