itaque <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0628" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0628"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Gat.</HI>  adprehensum hominem, sanavit.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Mm.</HI>  adprehensum
