INCIPIT SECUNDUM MARCUM †.</P></DIV3> <DIV3 COM="0719" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0719">CODEX VERONENSIS.</HEAD> <COL N="0502"></COL> <CAPTION COM="0502">CAPUT PRIMUM.</CAPTION> <COL N="0502"></COL> <P COM="0502">1. Quoniam quidem
