quod <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0505" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0505"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">nascetur,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">ex te,</HI>  etiam in tex. Gr.</NOTE>  nascetur
† Sanctus
 <COL N="0508"></COL> vocabitur
