suum,
 <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Juxta tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>mnhsqhðnai.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  memorari
† misericordiae.
