 <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">magnus,</HI>  etiam cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>mevgaû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  magnus
† super
