 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn oålhé thðé ojreinhðé.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  in universa
