autem XII.
 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0575" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0575"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>maqhtaúû aujtouð.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  discipulis
