 <COL N="0576"></COL> domum
intraveritis,
ibi manete,
et inde <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0575" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0575"></COL> Deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">ne,</HI>  etiam
in tex. Graeco.</NOTE> 
proficiscimini
†.
