9. Ait <NOTE N="(d)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0575" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0575"></COL> Ita et cod, Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>dev.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  autem †
Herodes: Johannen
ego
