 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0577" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0577"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">ad eum,</HI>  etiam Vers.
Goth.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aujtwðé</FOREIGN></NOTE>  ad eum †
