illi: Dimitte
 <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0577" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0577"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>toún oæclon.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  turbam †,
ut eant circa
