 <NOTE N="(f)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0577" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0577"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">discipulis,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">suis,</HI>  etiam in tex. Gr.</NOTE>  discipulis †,
