propter me,
 <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0579" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0579"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">ille,</HI>  etiam tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oußtoû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  ille † salvam
