se autem
perdat, et
 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0579" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0579"></COL> Veron. et Vercell. omittunt  <HI REND="ITALIC">sui;</HI>  juxta tex. Gr.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oJ zhmivwqeivû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  detrimentum
