28. Factum est
autem post
haec verba,
fere post
dies octo
adsumpsit
 <COL N="0582"></COL> Petrum <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0581" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0581"></COL> Juxta ordinem tex. Gr.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú 1Iwavnnhn kaiú 1Iavkwbon.</FOREIGN></NOTE> , et
Johannen,
et Jacobum †,
