Hierusalem.
32. Petrus vero,
et qui cum
illo <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0581" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0581"></COL> Veron. omittit  <HI REND="ITALIC">erant,</HI>  post  <HI REND="ITALIC">cum illo,</HI>  juxta Graecam
syntaxin:  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú oiJ suún aujtwðé, høsan bebarhmevnoi.</FOREIGN></NOTE> , erant
grabati †
a somno. Et
