55. Et conversus,
increpavit
illos, <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0585" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0585"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú eiøpen.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  et
dixit †: Nescitis
cujus
spiritus estis:
56. quia Filius
hominis non
venit animas
 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0585" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0585"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">hominum,</HI>  etiam tex. Gr.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajnqrwvpwn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  hominum †
perdere, sed
