ad illum: <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0585" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0585"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">Domine,</HI>  pariter
tex. Gr.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kuvrie.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  Domine,
† sequar
