 <NOTE N="(g)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0587" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0587"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eijû
pavnta tovpon kaiú povlin.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  in omnem
