3. Et ecce ego
mitto vos,
sicut agnos
 <NOTE N="(i)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0587" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0587"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn mevswé
luvkwn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  in medio
