vestra <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0589" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0589"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">in pedibus,</HI>  etiam cod. Cant.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eijû touúû povdaû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  in
pedibus, † extergimus
in
vos:
tamen hoc
scitote, quia
adpropiavit
regnum Dei.
12. Dico vobis,
Sodomis
 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0589" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0589"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn thðé basileiva (touð qeouð).</FOREIGN></NOTE>  in regno †
tolerabilius
erit, quam
