13. Vae tibi Corozain,
 <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0589" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0589"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú Bhqsaiçdav</FOREIGN></NOTE>  et
