pernit,</HI>  etiam in cod. Cant.</NOTE>  eum, †
qui me misit.
 <NOTE N="(f)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0589" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0589"></COL> Etiam cod. Cant. addit,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oJ deú ejmouð ajkouvwn, ajkouvei touð ajposteivlantovû me.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  Qui autem
