inimici:
et nihil
 <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0591" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0591"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJmaðû ajdikhvsei.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  vos nocebit. †
20. Verumtamen
