nomina vestra
scripta sunt
 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0591" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0591"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn twðé oujranwðé.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  in caelo †.
21. In ipsa hora
exultavit <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0591" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0591"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">in,</HI>  etiam cod. Cant.,
 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  in †
Spiritu Sancto,
