23. Et conversus ad
 <NOTE N="(e)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0591" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0591"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">discipulos.</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">suos,</HI>  in tex. quoque
Gr.</NOTE>  discipulos †,
dixit:
Beati itaque oculi
qui vident, quae
24. <NOTE N="(f)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0591" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0591"></COL> Ante  <HI REND="ITALIC">videtis,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">vos,</HI>  pariter in tex. Gr.</NOTE>  videtis †. Dico
enim vobis, quod
multi Prophetae,
