 <COL N="0594D"></COL> Diliges Dominum
Deum
tuum <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0593" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0593"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn,</FOREIGN>  hic, et fere ubicunque Vulg. legit  <HI REND="ITALIC">ex.</HI></NOTE>  in †
toto corde
