 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0593" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0593"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">tuis,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ex omni mente tua,</HI> 
etiam in cod. Cant.</NOTE>  tuis †: et
proximum
tuum, sicut
