quae
etiam sedens
secus pedes
 <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0595" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0595"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touð 1Ihsouð.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  Jesu †, audiebat
verbum
illius.
40. Martha autem
satagebat circa
