41. Et respondens,
dixit
illi <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0595" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0595"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oJ 1Ihsouðû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  Jesus †:
Martha, Martha,
 <COL N="0596"></COL> 42. Maria optimam
partem
