illi.</P> <CAPTION COM="0596">CAPUT XI.</CAPTION> <P COM="0596">1. Et factum
est cum esset
 <NOTE N="(c)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0595" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0595"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">ipse,</HI>  etiam tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aujtovn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  ipse † in
quodam loco
orans; <NOTE N="(d)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0595" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0595"></COL> Addit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  cod. quoque Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú</FOREIGN></NOTE>  et †,
