 <NOTE N="(f)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0595" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0595"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">fiat voluntas tua in caelo et in terra</HI>  etiam tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>genhqhvtw toú qevlhmav sou, wJû ejn
