3. Panem nostrum
cottidianum
da nobis hodie.
4. Et dimitte
nobis <NOTE N="(g)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0595" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0595"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>taú ojfeilhvmata hJmwðn, wJû kaiú hJmeiðû ajfivemen toiðû ojfeilevtaiû hJmwðn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  debita
