 <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sed libera nos a malo,</HI>  etiam tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajllaú rJuðsai hJmaðû ajpoú touð ponhrouð.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  sed
