 <NOTE N="(d)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0631" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0631"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">turbae,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">multae,</HI>  etiam in cod.
Cant. et Vercellensi.</NOTE>  turbae †;
