 <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0635" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0635"></COL> Ante  <HI REND="ITALIC">unam,</HI>  deest  <HI REND="ITALIC">drachmam,</HI>  etiam in cod. Cant.</NOTE>  unam †,
nonne accendit
lucernam,
et
