 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajpevcontoû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  abesset †,
