27. Isque dixit
ei: <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">quia,</HI>  etiam text. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oåti.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  Quia †
frater tuus
venit, et occidit
