28. Indignatus
est autem, et
nolebat intrare.
Pater
 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>dev.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  vero † illius
egressus,
