20. Erat <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0645" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0645"></COL> Addit.  <HI REND="ITALIC">autem,</HI>  etiam tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>dev.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  autem †
