a longe,
et Lazarum
in sinu
ejus <NOTE N="(d)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0645" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0645"></COL> Addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">requiescentem,</HI>  etiam cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajnapauovmenon.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  requiescentem
†:
24. et ipse exclamans,
dixit:
Pater Abraham,
miserere
mei,
et mitte Lazarum,
ut
intingat extremum
digiti sui
in aquam,
 <NOTE N="(e)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0645" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0645"></COL> Ita et tex. Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiv.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  et † refrigeret
