3. Ingressae <NOTE N="(e)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0709" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0709"></COL> Ita et cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>dev.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  autem
