 <NOTE N="(f)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0709" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0709"></COL> Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">corpus,</HI>  deest
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Domini Jesu,</HI>  etiam in cod. Cant.</NOTE>  corpus †.
