illi <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0830" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0830"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Gat.</HI>  singillatim: Numquid ego sum?  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vulg.</HI>  singulatim:
