 <COL N="0812"></COL> sed crediderit
 <NOTE N="(b)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y ED="Blanchinus, Josephus" COM="0811" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0811"></COL> Et ita cod. Cant.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>toú mevllon oÝ ejaún eiøphé genhvsetai aujtwðé.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  futurum,
