quoque Calaritanus in lib. II pro S. Athanasio habet,
 <COL N="0861C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">si peccaverit,</HI>  etc.</P> <P COM="0861">Matth. XIX, 21. Brixian. et Corbeien.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">vende omnia,
