habet,  <HI REND="ITALIC">a refrigescentibus.</HI></P> <CAPTION COM="0899">CAP. XXII.</CAPTION> <COL N="0899D"></COL> <P COM="0899">57. Mss. 4,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oJ deú hjrnhvsato levgwn,</FOREIGN> 
