desideratur.</P> <P COM="0900">19. Mss. 9 legunt,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touvtou.</FOREIGN>  Brix.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">hujus.</HI></P> <P COM="0900">24. Mss. 9 habent,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>toiðû ajkouvousin.</FOREIGN>  In Brix. legitur,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">credentibus.</HI></P> <CAPTION COM="0900">CAP. V.</CAPTION> <P COM="0900">1. Mss. 6 legunt,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>høsan deú wJû discivlioi.</FOREIGN> 
