 <COL N="0900B"></COL> Brix. legit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quod virtutes tales.</HI></P> <P COM="0900">11. Mss. 9 concorditer legunt ita:  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Amhún levgw uåmiðn,
ajnektovteron eæstai Sodovmoiû hÞ GomovrjrJoiû ejn hJmevraé krivsewû,
hÞ thðé povlei ejkeivnhé.</FOREIGN>  Verc et Brix.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Amen dico
