habet,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quia . . . nondum intelligitis.</HI></P> <CAPTION COM="0900">CAP. IX.</CAPTION> <P COM="0900">38. Mss. 9 legunt,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oåti oujk ajkolouvqei
