 <COL N="0919D"></COL> relinquet.</HI></P></DIV1> <DIV1 SECOND=YES COM="0919"><P COM="0919">1. Exod. III. 6.  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0120919B" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> 
