 <HI REND="ITALIC">Et dederunt in escam meam fel; et in siti
mea propinaverunt mihi acetum.</HI></P> <P COM="0928">2. Matth. XXVII, 48.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Acceptam spongiam implevit
aceto, et imposuit arundini, et dabat ei bibere.</HI></P> <P COM="0928">Joan. XIX, 29.  <HI REND="ITALIC">illi autem spongiam plenam aceto
hyssopo circumponentes, obtulerunt ori ejus.</HI></P> <P COM="0928">3. Psal. LXVIII, 22.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kaiú eædwkan eijû toú brwðmav mou
