 <COL N="0928C"></COL> in escam meam fel, et in siti mea potaverunt
me aceto.</HI></P> <P COM="0928">4. Matth. XXVII, 48.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kaiú labwún spovggon, plhvsaû
te oæxouû, kaiú periqeiúû kalavmwé, ejpovtizen aujtovn.</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Et accipiens
spongiam, implensque aceto, et circumponens
arundini, potabat eum.</HI></P> <P COM="0928">Joan. XIX, 29.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>OiJ deú plhvsanteû spovggon oæxouû, kaiú
uJsswvpwé periqevnteû proshvnegkan aujtouð twðé stovmati.</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Illi
