latronum est domus mea, ubi invocatum est nomen
meum in ea?</HI></P> <P COM="0940">4. Matth. XXI, 13.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>2O oiøkovû mou, oiøkoû proseuchðû
klhqhvsetai, uJmeiðû deú aujtoún ejpoihvsate sphvlaion lhéstwðn.</FOREIGN> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Domus mea, domus orationis vocabitur: vos autem
illam fecistis speluncam latronum.</HI></P> <P COM="0940">Marc. XI, 17.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>4Oti oJ oiøkovû mou, oiøkoû proseuchðû klhqhvsetai
paðsi toiðû eæqnesin× uJmeiðû deú ejpoihvsate aujtoún
sphvlaion lhéstwðn.</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Quia domus mea, domus orationis
