 <HI REND="ITALIC">Ex Aegypto,</HI>  etc. ut in Matth. Vulg. edit.</P> <P COM="0942">5. Ose. XI, 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ex Aegypto vocavi filios suos.</HI></P> <P COM="0942">6. Ose. XI, 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ex Aegypto vocavi filium meum.</HI></P> <P COM="0942">7. Matth. II, 15. Vercell., Veron., Corb. et Brix.,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Ex Aegypto vocavi filium meum.</HI></P></DIV1> <DIV1 SECOND=YES COM="0942"><P COM="0942">1. Jonae II, 1.  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0120942D" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Et fuit Jonan in visceribus piscis tribus diebus
