ita erit et Filius hominis generationi isti.</HI></P> <P COM="0942"><COL N="0943A"></COL> 3. Jon. II, 1.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kaiú høn 1Iwnaðû ejn thðé koilivaé touð khvtouû
