ajpoú megavlou aujtwðn eåwû mikrouð aujtwðn.</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Et crediderunt
 <COL N="0943C"></COL> viri Nineve Deo, et praedicaverunt jejunium, et vestiti
sunt saccis a magno eorum usque ad parvum eorum.</HI></P> <P COM="0943">4. Matth. XII, 41. et Luc. XI, 32.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>3Andreû Nineuiètai</FOREIGN> 
(Luc.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Nineui0,</FOREIGN>  Ninevi)  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajnasthvsontai ejn thðé krivsei metaú
