hujus . . . in praedicationem.</HI></P></DIV1> <DIV1 SECOND=YES COM="0943"><P COM="0943">1. Mich. V, 1.  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0120943B" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> 
