auJthðû.</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Dispartietur pater in filium, et filius in patrem,
mater,</HI>  etc., ut in Luc. Vulg. edit.</P> <P COM="0944">5. Mich. VII, 6.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Quia filius contumeliam facit patri,
