nurum suam, et nurus adversus socrum suam.</HI></P></DIV1> <DIV1 SECOND=YES COM="0945"><P COM="0945">1. Zach. XI, 12. 13.  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0120945A" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Et appenderunt mercedem meam triginta
