 <POEM COM="1008"><L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Pavnta qeoiðû ajnevqhkan 4Omhroû q1 2Hsivodovû te,</FOREIGN></L> <L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>4Ossa par1 ajnqrwvpoisin ojneivdea kaiú yovgoû eæsti,</FOREIGN></L> <L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Klevptein, moiceuvein te kaiú ajllhvlouû ajpateuvein.</FOREIGN></L></POEM> 

 <ED>LINDNER</ED>  ad Athenag.—Cum Athenagora consentit
